<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45096" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sponda</span></b> , ae, f.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>the frame</i> of a
			bedstead, sofa, etc., <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 8, 657</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Petr. 97, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">94,
			8</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A bed</i>, <i>couch</i>, <i>sofa</i> (syn. lectus), <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 1,
				698</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. Epod. 3, 22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. F. 2,
				345</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 3, 91, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Caes. 49</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A bier</i>, <i><span class="en">Mart. 10,
				5, 9</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Latin Dictionary</u>
        </u> (Charlton T. Lewis, Charles Short, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1879) </div>
</div>